sequenceDiagram
    participant Rider
    participant Request as Ride Request Service
    participant Candidate as Candidate Service
    participant Ranker
    participant Dispatch
    participant Driver
    participant Commit as Commit Gate
    participant Replay

    Rider->>Request: Request ride
    Request->>Candidate: Fetch eligible drivers
    Candidate->>Ranker: Fresh candidates
    Ranker->>Dispatch: Ranked shortlist
    Dispatch->>Driver: Offer with matchHoldId
    Driver-->>Dispatch: Accept
    Dispatch->>Commit: Check freshness, conflict, pricing, fairness, safety
    Commit-->>Dispatch: Pass
    Dispatch-->>Rider: Confirm matchId
    Dispatch->>Replay: Write decision replay card
